00:19:22,140 --> 00:19:28,530
Mismatches counts our tamper test, and the archived count went up by one, because we archived the lease.

213
00:19:29,290 --> 00:19:37,493
To summarise the parts. The front end is React. The back end is FastAPI in Python. MongoDB stores the data.

214
00:19:37,493 --> 00:19:43,013
RustFS in development, and Cloudflare R2 in production, store the files.

215
00:19:43,013 --> 00:19:50,450
web3.py talks to a Solidity smart contract on the Sepolia test network. Docker runs the services,

216
